{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测访问 Telegram API 的请求。对应需求：即时通讯 C2。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux访问Telegram API","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n进程访问 api.telegram.org 等接口。\n\n### 为何重要\n常被用作廉价 C2 或数据外传通道。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"af1e36fe-0abd-4463-b5ec-4e276dec0b26","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: Telegram C2"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"start\", \"exec_event\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"exec_event\", \"process_started\") and\nprocess.name in (\"curl\", \"wget\") and process.command_line like \"*api.telegram.org*\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1071.001","name":"Web Protocols","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/001/"}]},{"id":"T1102","name":"Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1102.002","name":"Bidirectional Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":6,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
